10
00:55:36,000 --> 00:55:42,000
Little Big Man is a 1970 American revisionist Western film directed by Arthur Penn,
adapted by Calder Willingham from Thomas Berger's 1964 novel of the same title.

11
01:01:09,600 --> 01:01:15,600
It stars Dustin Hoffman, Chief Dan George, Faye Dunaway,
Martin Balsam, Jeff Corey and Richard Mulligan.

12
01:06:43,200 --> 01:06:49,200
The film follows the life of a white man who was raised by members of the Cheyenne nation during
the 19th century, and then attempts to reintegrate with American pioneer society.

13
01:12:16,800 --> 01:12:22,800
Although broadly categorized as a Western, or an epic, the film encompasses
several literary/film genres, including comedy, drama and adventure.

14
01:17:50,400 --> 01:17:56,400
It parodies typical tropes of the Western genre, contrasting the lives of white
settlers and Native Americans throughout the progression of the boy's life.

15
01:23:24,000 --> 01:23:30,000
Little Big Man is an early revisionist Western in its sympathetic depiction of Native
Americans, and its exposure of the villainous practices of the United States Cavalry.

16
01:28:57,600 --> 01:29:03,600
The revision uses elements of satire and tragedy to
examine prejudice and injustice.

17
01:34:31,200 --> 01:34:37,200
Little Big Man is an anti-establishment film of the period, indirectly protesting America's
involvement in the Vietnam War by portraying the United States Armed Forces negatively.

18
01:40:04,800 --> 01:40:10,800
The film was released to American theatres by National General Pictures on December
23, 1970, to widespread critical acclaim and commercial success.

19
01:45:38,400 --> 01:45:44,400
Several retrospective reviews have positioned Little Big Man as
one of the best American films of the 1970s.

20
01:51:12,000 --> 01:51:18,000
The film received three BAFTA Award nominations, including
for Best Actor in a Leading Role for Hoffman.

21
01:56:45,600 --> 01:56:51,600
Chief Dan George received an Academy Award nomination for Best Supporting Actor, the
first Indigenous North American actor to be nominated for an Oscar.

22
02:02:19,200 --> 02:02:25,200
In 2014, Little Big Man was deemed "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant" by the
Library of Congress, and selected for preservation in the National Film Registry.

23
